@startuml
title C2: AI Platform

package "AI Platform" {
  [Model Registry] --> [ML Model Server]
  [ML Model Server] --> [Inference API]
  [Inference API] --> [Preprocessing]
  [Preprocessing] --> [Postprocessing]
  [Postprocessing] --> [Results DB]
}

[Web Portal] --> [Inference API] : Отправка данных
[Inference API] --> [Web Portal] : Результат (JSON)

note right of [ML Model Server]
  Модели:
  - Анализ МРТ
  - Прогноз аритмии
  - Ранняя диагностика
end note

note right of [Preprocessing]
  Нормализация, ресайз
  Обрезка артефактов
end note

@enduml
